{"id":"cfb4df0f853ccdd7","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-function-restriction.md","title":"Function Restriction","display":"df-function-restriction — Function Restriction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-function-restriction","aliases":["58-df-function-restriction"],"display":"df-function-restriction — Function Restriction","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-function-restriction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-function-restriction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-function-restriction — Function Restriction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,A,B,Y\\in V\">\\(f,A,B,Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function\\text{-}restriction} \\vdash \\forall f,A,B,Y\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,Y)\\land B\\subseteq A\\to f\\upharpoonright B=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f:x\\in B\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function\\text{-}restriction} \\vdash \\forall f,A,B,Y\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,Y)\\land B\\subseteq A\\to f\\upharpoonright B=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f:x\\in B\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f \\upharpoonright B\">\\(f \\upharpoonright B\\)</span> 读作：<strong><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 上的限制</strong>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f \\upharpoonright B\">\\(f \\upharpoonright B\\)</span> 是将函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 的定义域限制到子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 上得到的函数。</li>\n<li>对于任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in B\">\\(x \\in B\\)</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(f \\upharpoonright B)(x) = f(x)\">\\((f \\upharpoonright B)(x) = f(x)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对于任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in A \\setminus B\">\\(x \\in A \\setminus B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f \\upharpoonright B\">\\(f \\upharpoonright B\\)</span> 的定义域中。</li>\n<li>注意：此处的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\upharpoonright\">\\(\\upharpoonright\\)</span> 是集合论中的标准限制操作，不同于结构归约中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A} \\upharpoonright S_0\">\\(\\mathfrak{A} \\upharpoonright S_0\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,A,B,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}function\\text{-}restriction} \\vdash \\forall f,A,B,Y\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,A,Y)\\land B\\subseteq A\\to f\\upharpoonright B=\\{\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in f:x\\in B\\}\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"f \\upharpoonright B","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"f \\upharpoonright B","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"x \\in B","display":false},{"tex":"(f \\upharpoonright B)(x) = f(x)","display":false},{"tex":"x \\in A \\setminus B","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"f \\upharpoonright B","display":false},{"tex":"\\upharpoonright","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A} \\upharpoonright S_0","display":false}],"bytes":1104,"backlinks":[{"id":"a99fa823030978de","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b158894eb95b8388","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"61744098b3a465ad","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$s\\upharpoonright n$ (set-function restriction, see [[58-df-function-restriction]])"},{"id":"da76983f71a491b6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a71444a10218d32c","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"db1c6422080cf240","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"b4f98ecd268d0aa3","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ and $f\\upharpoonright A$ is function restriction (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]], [[../batch13/58-df-function-restric